1. copy every thing in this folder to Ubuntu /home/dan/weekly_report/;
2. copy config/weekly_report_tcp_server.desktop to ~/.config/autostart/;
3. restart Ubuntu;
4. copy scripts in windows/ to Windows C:\Users\nidan\weekreport\;
5. move "gen week report.bat" to Desktop in Windows;
6. make sure there is already a old weekly_report doc in /home/dan/weekly_report/XXyear/;
7. double click "gen week report.bat" to generate week report in outlook draft folder;